			"date": "2020-09-01T02:21:01.000Z",
			"content": "My photography portfolio website is at #108, but I think the most incredible thing about <a href=\"https://twitter.com/eleven_ty\">@eleven_ty</a> community is having the resources to actually learn more and build a more inclusive and performant website.\n\n<a href=\"https://yeshyendamuri.netlify.app/\">yeshyendamuri.netlify.app</a>\n\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/eleventy-leaderboard-speedlify/\"></a>",
