			},
			"date": "2020-09-01T02:24:53.000Z",
			"content": "I'm loving the focus on performance and a11y that <a href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\">@ZachLeat</a> is putting in to 11ty. Using Lighthouse scores and Axe violations to rank sites and starters is perfect. <a href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/eleventy-leaderboard-speedlify/\">zachleat.com/web/eleventy-l…</a>",
