			},
			"date": "2020-09-01T10:54:25.000Z",
			"content": "“Eleventy Leaderboards v2 via Speedlify—<a href=\"http://zachleat.com\">zachleat.com</a>”\n\nAutomatic, self-hosted performance monitoring is starting to look fairly straightforward for Eleventy users <a href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/eleventy-leaderboard-speedlify/\">zachleat.com/web/eleventy-l…</a>\n\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"http://zachleat.com/\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
			"type": "mention",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 846280,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/NickColley/status/1300752960754941953",
