			},
			"date": "2020-09-01T11:10:47.000Z",
			"content": "You considered doing a pattern like this:\n\n&lt;a href=\"dashboard\" as=\"speedlify-score&gt;link to dashboard&lt;/a&gt;\n\nOr having the anchor nested inside the tags?\n\nWould mean if it fails you've got a regular link to the page... 👀\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/eleven_ty\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/speedlify\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 846355,
			"parentId": 0,
