			},
			"date": "2020-09-01T13:42:05.000Z",
			"content": "do you mean `is`? I do like that pattern but no Safari support. Maybe &lt;a href&gt;&lt;speedlify-score&gt;Link to Dashboard&lt;/…&gt;&lt;/a&gt;?\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/NickColley\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/eleven_ty\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/speedlify\"></a>",
