			},
			"date": "2023-11-13T17:42:16.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://seocommunity.social/@simoncox\" class=\"u-url\">@<span>simoncox</span></a></span> accurate! better in perf, best practices, seo—worse in a11y, 4 hundos</p><p>26:</p><p>Performance ????<br />    343 / 859<br />Accessibility ????<br />    538 / 859<br />Best Practices ????<br />    695 / 859<br />SEO ????<br />    570 / 859<br />Perfect 4×????<br />    219 / 859</p><p>27:</p><p>Performance ????<br />    356 / 907<br />Accessibility ????<br />    523 / 907<br />Best Practices ????<br />    743 / 907<br />SEO ????<br />    609 / 907<br />Perfect 4×????<br />    213 / 907</p>",
